<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Grow your audience, sell digital products, automate conversations, and run your creator business from one beautiful page.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= siteName %> — The Creator Business Toolkit">
  <meta property="og:description" content="One page to grow your audience and turn followers into customers.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCA2NCA2NCI+CiAgPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjY0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjY0IiByeD0iMTQiIGZpbGw9IiMxMjYxZWYiLz4KICA8cGF0aCBkPSJNMzYgOCAxNCAzNWgxNWwtMiAyMSAyMy0zMEgzNWwxLTE4WiIgZmlsbD0iI2ZmZiIvPgo8L3N2Zz4=" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Manrope:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{--paper:#fbfaf6;--ink:#111827;--blue:#1261ef;--navy:#07134f;--lime:#b9ed28;--coral:#ff6c62;--muted:#667085;--line:#dce2ec;--surface:#fff;--pale:#e8f3ff;--shadow:0 22px 60px #1224551c}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.announcement{height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.announcement a{text-decoration:underline}.nav{height:78px;padding:0 4vw;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:10}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:21px;font-weight:800}.mark{width:32px;height:32px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:7px 2px;transform:rotate(-4deg)}.brand b{color:var(--blue)}.navlinks{display:flex;gap:5px;padding:5px;background:#f1f3f6;border-radius:99px}.navlinks a{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:99px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.navlinks a:hover{background:#fff}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:42px;padding:0 20px;border-radius:99px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.btn-blue{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #1261ef3d}.btn-white{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);box-shadow:0 10px 30px #06134732}.menu{display:none;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:27px}.mobile-nav{display:none}
    .hero{min-height:920px;width:calc(100% - 32px);margin:auto;border-radius:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1261ef;color:#fff}.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 18% 18%,#ffffff59,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse 46% 32% at 78% 12%,#ffffff42,transparent 65%),radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 40% at 55% 92%,#ffffff26,transparent 70%),linear-gradient(180deg,#4d8fff 0%,#1261ef 48%,#0a2f9e 100%)}.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(#1015a5a8 0%,#1261ef70 45%,transparent 78%)}.hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;width:min(820px,90%);margin:auto;padding-top:68px}.pill{display:inline-flex;padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff60;border-radius:99px;background:#ffffff1c;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.pill:before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;margin:2px 8px 0 0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6.2vw,87px);line-height:.95;margin:22px 0 16px}em{font-family:"Instrument Serif",Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.hero p{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.65;color:#ffffffe3}.hero-actions{margin-top:25px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:20px}.video-link{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.stage{position:absolute;z-index:3;width:min(820px,78%);height:370px;left:50%;bottom:-24px;transform:translateX(-50%);border:3px solid #fff;border-radius:13px 13px 0 0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 28px 70px #0613474d;overflow:hidden}.browser{height:36px;background:#edf1f6;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 13px;font-size:9px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}.browser:before{content:"● ● ●";float:left;color:var(--coral);word-spacing:2px}.dashboard{padding:24px 30px}.dashhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.dashhead span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.dashhead strong{display:block;font-size:17px}.avatar{width:35px;height:35px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-size:10px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:20px 0 12px}.stat,.chart{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px}.stat small{display:block;font-size:7px;color:var(--muted)}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:17px;margin:4px 0}.stat i{font-size:8px;color:#16884e}.chart{height:150px}.chart label{font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.bars{height:100px;display:flex;align-items:end;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bars i{flex:1;background:var(--blue);border-radius:2px 2px 0 0}.sale{position:absolute;right:22px;bottom:18px;padding:12px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-size:9px}.sale b{display:block;font-size:11px}.proof{padding:32px;text-align:center;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.proof small{display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:800}.proof div{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:60px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
    section.content{padding:105px 0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--blue);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.heading{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:46px}.heading h2,.split-title h2,.faq h2,.cta h2{font-size:clamp(41px,5vw,67px);line-height:.98;margin-bottom:20px}.heading p,.split-title p,.faq p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.visual{height:285px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:25px;background:var(--pale)}.card:nth-child(2) .visual{background:#e7fac2}.card:nth-child(3) .visual{background:#ffe3de}.mock{width:78%;padding:24px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:rotate(-2deg)}.mock b{display:block;font-family:"Instrument Serif",serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1;margin:9px 0 16px}.mock span{display:block;margin:7px 0;font-size:10px}.mock .fake-btn{padding:9px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:5px;font-weight:800}.card:nth-child(2) .mock{border:6px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:0;border-radius:22px 22px 0 0;text-align:center;transform:rotate(3deg) translateY(25px)}.card:nth-child(3) .fake-btn{background:var(--coral)}.copy{padding:26px}.copy small{color:var(--blue);font-weight:800}.copy h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.18;margin:10px 0}.copy p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}.copy a{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue)}
    .sell{padding:100px 0;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.split-title{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr;align-items:end;gap:60px}.split-title .kicker{color:var(--lime)}.split-title p{color:#ffffffae}.money{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);margin-top:52px;border:1px solid #ffffff22}.money article{padding:42px;border:1px solid #ffffff18}.money .num{float:right;font:44px "Instrument Serif";color:#ffffff1f}.money .icon{width:48px;height:48px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:45px;border:1px solid #ffffff30;border-radius:50%;color:var(--lime);font-size:20px}.money small,.money a{color:var(--lime);font-weight:800}.money h3{font-size:28px;margin:10px 0}.money p{max-width:430px;color:#ffffffa6;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.money a{font-size:12px}
    .workflow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}.checks{padding:0;list-style:none;line-height:2.2;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.checks li:before{content:"✓";color:var(--blue);margin-right:10px}.map{height:450px;position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background-color:#fff;background-image:radial-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:22px 22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.node{position:absolute;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.node.one{left:8%;top:12%}.node.two{right:7%;top:42%;color:var(--blue)}.node.three{left:12%;bottom:12%;color:#18804c}.notice{position:absolute;right:6%;bottom:7%;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:7px}.notice small{display:block;color:#ffffff99}.notice strong{font-size:18px}.stories{padding:105px 0;background:var(--pale)}.quotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:16px}.quote,.metric{padding:36px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.quote.big{grid-row:span 2;min-height:400px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.stars{color:#f1bf13}.quote blockquote{margin:30px 0;font:28px/1.3 "Instrument Serif"}.quote.big blockquote{font-size:39px}.person{font-size:12px}.person b{display:block}.person span{color:var(--muted)}.metric{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;background:var(--lime)}.metric strong{font:70px "Instrument Serif"}.metric span{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5}.faq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:90px}.faq details{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.faq summary{padding:24px 0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:800}.faq details p{font-size:13px;padding-right:30px}.cta{width:calc(100% - 32px);margin:auto;padding:100px 20px;text-align:center;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-radius:12px}.cta .kicker{color:var(--lime)}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,92px);margin-bottom:18px}.cta p{color:#ffffffc2}.footer{padding:70px 0 30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:50px}.footer p{margin-top:15px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.footer nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.legal{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}
    @media(max-width:850px){.navlinks,.actions{display:none}.menu{display:block}.mobile-nav.open{display:flex;position:absolute;top:70px;left:15px;right:15px;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-weight:800}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.split-title,.workflow,.faq{grid-template-columns:1fr}.quotes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.quote.big{grid-row:auto}.money{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media(max-width:600px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 28px)}.announcement{font-size:10px}.nav{height:66px;padding:0 16px}.hero{width:calc(100% - 16px);min-height:680px;border-radius:10px}.hero-copy{padding-top:45px}.hero h1{font-size:45px}.hero p{font-size:14px}.hero-actions{flex-direction:column}.stage{width:94%;height:285px}.dashboard{padding:18px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stat:nth-child(3){display:none}.proof div{gap:18px}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visual{height:270px}section.content,.stories{padding:78px 0}.heading h2,.split-title h2,.faq h2{font-size:43px}.sell{padding:78px 0}.money article{padding:30px}.map{height:380px}.node.one{left:4%}.node.two{right:4%}.node.three{left:5%}.notice{right:4%;bottom:4%}.quote.big blockquote{font-size:31px}.metric{display:grid}.faq{gap:35px}.cta{width:calc(100% - 16px);padding:75px 20px}.footer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer nav{flex-wrap:wrap}.legal{flex-direction:column;gap:8px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body id="top">
  <div class="announcement">✦ Launch your creator business in minutes <a href="/signup">Start free →</a></div>
  <header class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="mark">ϟ</span><span>page<b>zaper</b></span></a>
    <nav class="navlinks" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#tools">Tools</a><a href="#sell">Sell</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav>
    <div class="actions"><a href="/login">Sign in</a><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/signup">Start for free →</a></div>
    <button class="menu" type="button" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
    <nav class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#tools">Tools</a><a href="#sell">Sell</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/signup">Start for free</a></nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-copy"><span class="pill">Built for ambitious creators</span><h1>The one page that turns<br><em>attention into income.</em></h1><p>Grow your audience, sell what you know, and automate the busywork—without juggling five different tools.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/signup">Build my page →</a><a class="video-link" href="#tools">▶ &nbsp;See how it works</a></div></div>
      <div class="stage"><div class="browser">pagezaper.com/arjuncreates</div><div class="dashboard"><div class="dashhead"><div><span>Good morning, Arjun</span><strong>Your business is growing.</strong></div><div class="avatar">AC</div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><small>PAGE VIEWS</small><strong>24.8K</strong><i>↗ 18.4%</i></div><div class="stat"><small>SALES</small><strong>₹48,290</strong><i>↗ 24.1%</i></div><div class="stat"><small>NEW LEADS</small><strong>1,284</strong><i>↗ 12.8%</i></div></div><div class="chart"><label>Revenue</label><div class="bars"><i style="height:28%"></i><i style="height:46%"></i><i style="height:38%"></i><i style="height:66%"></i><i style="height:54%"></i><i style="height:76%"></i><i style="height:62%"></i><i style="height:88%"></i><i style="height:72%"></i><i style="height:96%"></i></div></div></div><div class="sale"><b>🟢 New sale!</b>The Creator Playbook · ₹999</div></div>
    </section>
    <div class="proof"><small>EVERYTHING YOUR CREATOR BUSINESS NEEDS</small><div><span>NO-CODE SETUP</span><span>INSTANT PAYOUTS</span><span>SMART AUTOMATION</span><span>BEAUTIFUL STOREFRONTS</span></div></div>

    <section class="content wrap" id="tools"><div class="heading"><span class="kicker">Grow your reach</span><h2>From follower to fan,<br><em>without the friction.</em></h2><p>Simple tools that help more people discover you—and give them a reason to stay.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="card"><div class="visual"><div class="mock"><small>AUTOMATIC REPLY</small><b>“Here’s the guide you asked for.”</b><span>✓ Triggered from a comment</span><div class="fake-btn">Send instantly →</div></div></div><div class="copy"><small>AUTODM</small><h3>Turn comments into conversations</h3><p>Send the right link, resource, or offer instantly when someone comments on your content.</p><a href="/signup">Explore AutoDM →</a></div></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="visual"><div class="mock"><small>@maya.makes</small><b>Designing a life I love.</b><span>Shop my templates</span><div class="fake-btn">Join the newsletter</div></div></div><div class="copy"><small>LINK-IN-BIO</small><h3>One page for everything you create</h3><p>Showcase your links, products, socials, and latest work in a storefront that feels unmistakably yours.</p><a href="/signup">Explore your page →</a></div></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="visual"><div class="mock"><small>FREE DOWNLOAD</small><b>The Creator Launch Checklist</b><span>✓ 32 practical steps</span><span>✓ Zero fluff</span><div class="fake-btn">Get the checklist</div></div></div><div class="copy"><small>LEAD MAGNETS</small><h3>Build an audience you own</h3><p>Share valuable freebies and capture the details you need to keep the conversation going.</p><a href="/signup">Explore lead magnets →</a></div></article>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sell" id="sell"><div class="wrap"><div class="split-title"><div><span class="kicker">Make your knowledge valuable</span><h2>More ways to earn.<br><em>One place to run it.</em></h2></div><p>Whether you sell a download or your time, <%= siteName %> makes the experience effortless for you and your customers.</p></div><div class="money">
      <article><span class="num">01</span><div class="icon">▣</div><small>DIGITAL PRODUCTS</small><h3>Sell your ideas, beautifully</h3><p>Upload guides, templates, videos, or audio and turn them into a polished, checkout-ready product page.</p><a href="/signup">Try it free →</a></article>
      <article><span class="num">02</span><div class="icon">◎</div><small>MEMBERSHIPS</small><h3>Bring your people together</h3><p>Launch a paid community and manage subscriptions without stitching together a stack of tools.</p><a href="/signup">Try it free →</a></article>
      <article><span class="num">03</span><div class="icon">▷</div><small>COURSES</small><h3>Teach at your own pace</h3><p>Organize lessons, welcome students, and create an end-to-end learning experience that feels premium.</p><a href="/signup">Try it free →</a></article>
      <article><span class="num">04</span><div class="icon">□</div><small>BOOKINGS</small><h3>Make your time valuable</h3><p>Share your availability, accept payment, and book coaching calls without the back-and-forth.</p><a href="/signup">Try it free →</a></article>
    </div></div></section>

    <section class="content wrap workflow"><div><span class="kicker">One connected workflow</span><h2>Your biggest ideas.<br><em>On autopilot.</em></h2><p>Turn a comment into a conversation, a conversation into a lead, and a lead into a customer.</p><ul class="checks"><li>Capture leads while you sleep</li><li>Send the right offer automatically</li><li>See every result in one dashboard</li></ul><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/signup">Build your workflow →</a></div><div class="map"><div class="node one">◎ &nbsp;Someone comments</div><div class="node two">ϟ &nbsp;<%= siteName %> responds</div><div class="node three">$ &nbsp;New customer</div><div class="notice"><small>Revenue today</small><strong>₹12,480</strong></div></div></section>

    <section class="stories" id="stories"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><span class="kicker">Creator stories</span><h2>Built for people<br><em>building something.</em></h2></div><div class="quotes"><article class="quote big"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“<%= siteName %> gave me the confidence to launch. My first digital product made 120 sales in one weekend.”</blockquote><div class="person"><b>Meera Shah</b><span>Illustrator &amp; educator</span></div></article><article class="quote"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I replaced four subscriptions and finally have a storefront that feels like my brand.”</blockquote><div class="person"><b>Rohan Kapoor</b><span>Fitness coach</span></div></article><article class="metric"><strong>3.2×</strong><span>more conversions when creators connect two or more <%= siteName %> tools.</span></article></div></div></section>

    <section class="content wrap faq" id="faq"><div><span class="kicker">Good questions</span><h2>Everything you<br><em>need to know.</em></h2><p>Still curious? Write to <a href="mailto:hello@<%= siteDomain %>">hello@<%= siteDomain %></a></p></div><div><details open><summary>What is <%= siteName %>?</summary><p><%= siteName %> is an all-in-one toolkit for creators to grow an audience, sell digital products, automate social conversations, and manage their online business.</p></details><details><summary>Who is <%= siteName %> for?</summary><p>It is designed for creators, coaches, educators, freelancers, and anyone turning useful knowledge into a sustainable online business.</p></details><details><summary>Can I start for free?</summary><p>Yes. Create your page and explore the core tools for free. Upgrade only when you need more advanced growth and selling features.</p></details><details><summary>What can I sell?</summary><p>Sell guides, templates, courses, memberships, event tickets, coaching sessions, or any other digital experience you create.</p></details></div></section>

    <section class="cta" id="start"><span class="kicker">Your audience is already waiting</span><h2>Make your next click<br><em>count.</em></h2><p>Start free. Build in minutes. Grow on your terms.</p><a class="btn btn-white" href="/signup">Start building for free →</a></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer wrap"><div><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="mark">ϟ</span><span>page<b>zaper</b></span></a><p>The simpler way to grow and monetize your audience.</p></div><nav><a href="#tools">Tools</a><a href="#sell">Sell</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav><div class="legal"><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= siteName %>. All rights reserved.</span><span>Made for creators everywhere.</span></div></footer>

  <script>
    const button = document.querySelector('.menu');
    const mobileNav = document.querySelector('.mobile-nav');
    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = mobileNav.classList.toggle('open');
      button.textContent = open ? '×' : '☰';
      button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    });
    mobileNav.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', () => {
      mobileNav.classList.remove('open');
      button.textContent = '☰';
      button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    }));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
